{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1306896-home-improvements-new-hollow-enhancements","id":1306896,"title":"Home Improvements: New Hollow Enhancements","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-22T10:39:41-07:00","id":1306896,"title":"Home Improvements: New Hollow Enhancements","content":"What changeling doesn't want a shiny Hollow kitted out with oddments a-jangle, a personal secret garden where one can while away the hours sipping kraken ink martinis and playing games on the Dreamcast 2? I've come up with a few homebrew enhancements for a more personalized or exotic Hollows. Feel free to add your own as well.<br /> <br /> <b>Hibernation Cocoon (\u2022): </b>Within the Hollow rests a chrome, ovoid device filled with a translucent cyan liquid, or maybe just a comfy bed with well-tucked sheets. Any character who sleeps in the Cocoon adds Hollow's dot rating to their Bastion Fortification, keeping their dreams safe from potential fae predators.<br /> <br /> <b>Tranquility Room (\u2022\u2022):</b> A portion of the Hollow takes the form of a prayer room, an inviting corner packed with soft pillows in soothing colors, or a sun-dappled glade where small birds and peaceful deer linger. Once per chapter, a changeling may spend an hour in the Tranquility Room in meditation, rolling Resolve + Composure. On a success, he heals a point of minor Clarity damage; on an exceptional success, he instead heals a point of severe Clarity damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Cagey (\u2022\u2022):</b> While most Hollows are made to keep intruders out, a few are designed as well to keep prisoners in. Whenever a character who is not the owner of a Hollow with this enhancement attempts Portaling of any kind while within, they must first succeed on a Clash of Wills against the Hollow itself (roll the Hollow's total Merit dot rating for its dice pool). An owner of the Hollow may grant exceptional permission to anyone she chooses to bypass this effect, either universally or for a specific instance of it, and she may revoke this permission at will as well, though she must be physically present inside the Hollow to do so.<br /> <br /> <b>Hob Attendant (\u2022 - \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022):</b> The Hollow is looked after by a hobgoblin servant, either one formed from the Glamour of the Hedge, or perhaps a Market-lurking mercenary who saw a good opportunity. The hobgoblin is pledge-bound to the Hollow, and cannot range far beyond its vicinity, but will keep the place tidy and perform other tasks pertaining to its particular nature. Design the attendant as a Retainer with a dot rating equal to the dots in this enhancement; in addition, the hobgoblin has a Wyrd equal to the enhancement's dot rating, with all the Contracts and Dread Powers that entails. So long as the Attendant is dutiful in its service, the Wyrd will provide the hobgoblin with this enhancement's dot rating in Glamour each week. Maintaining the presence of the Hob Attendant requires the changeling to accept a point of Goblin Debt at the beginning of each story.<br /> <br /> <b>Lucky Charm (\u2022\u2022 or \u2022\u2022\u2022):</b> The Hollow contains a strange icon, wondrous piece of treasure, or bizarre sculpture that brings a scrap of good fortune in certain domains. Choose a Skill; the Lucky Charm provides the 9-again quality on rolls that use the Skill within the Hollow at two dots, and the 8-again quality at three dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1423,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","user":"espritdecalmar","date":". 04-22-2019, 02:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T11:09:34-07:00","id":1306907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1306896-home-improvements-new-hollow-enhancements#post1306896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Hibernation Cocoon (\u2022): </b>Within the Hollow rests a chrome, ovoid device filled with a translucent cyan liquid, or maybe just a comfy bed with well-tucked sheets. Any character who sleeps in the Cocoon does not form a Bastion in the Hedge, keeping their dreams safe from potential fae predators.</div> </div> </div> </div>This feels more appropriate to the Underhill metaphysics, because in 2e a Bastion forms behind an elusive Hedgeway and needs express invitation or expensive oneiromancy to get into. Maybe have it add the Hollow's rating to the Bastion's Fortification level instead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T11:16:24-07:00","id":1306910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1306896-home-improvements-new-hollow-enhancements?p=1306907#post1306907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This feels more appropriate to the Underhill metaphysics, because in 2e a Bastion forms behind an elusive Hedgeway and needs express invitation or expensive oneiromancy to get into. Maybe have it add the Hollow's rating to the Bastion's Fortification level instead?</div> </div> </div> </div>Good catch. I keep forgetting how Bastions in 2e work, for some reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T09:54:13-07:00","id":1307507,"title":"","content":"Would a controlled patch of Thorns in a secret compartment, that allows you to have a safer place to leave items you want to turn into Hedge-Forged Tokens, be viable as a 5 dot or even 4 dot upgrade?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T10:26:38-07:00","id":1307522,"title":"","content":"I think any sort of control over Thorns makes it stop being Thorns. Either that the effects of Thorns dies down once put under control, or it never becomes truly contained. Put a fence around a large enough portion of Thorns and you might find that you can walk into that patch and find yourself in a different part of the Hedge instead of hitting the other side of the enclosure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T11:21:20-07:00","id":1307541,"title":"","content":"Sounds about right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T19:26:54-07:00","id":1510304,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1423_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1423\" data-vbnamecard=\"1423\">espritdecalmar</a><br /> <br /> Hey! I made some of my own for Night Horrors: Scourging Thorns, and was wondering if you wanted to pitch your ideas into the book as well! Here they are:<br /> <br /> <b>Mobile (\u2022\u2022\u2022): </b>The Hollow can move at up to Speed 10 for an unlimited distance and does so at the changeling\u2019s whim. The changeling chooses the direction and can alter it at her discretion. It may be used in Hedge Chases, either with the Changeling directing it (Changeling rolls normally) or the Hollow moves on its own (the Hollow rolls double its Merit dot rating as a dice pool). Mobile Hollows may not be taken outside of the Hedge.<br /> <br /> <b>Vault (\u2022\u2022): </b>The Hollow has a secret vault inside of it. The vault is immune to mundane Larceny rolls, while supernatural attempts suffer a penalty equal to the Hollow rating. Failing a roll to open the vault alerts the Hollow's owners, even if they are not present. The Hollow's owners may open it freely, but may also create a &quot;key,&quot; similar to a Hedge Gate, that bypasses the vault's security. The vault can hold up to 20 points of Size inside of it, although it is not recommended to put living creatures inside.<br /> <br /> <b>Hollow-Haunt (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022): </b>The Hollow has a Hedge Ghost bound to it with a Wyrd rating equal to twice the enhancement\u2019s dot rating. The Hedge Ghost cannot leave, but will defend the Hollow with its life. Maintaining the Hollow-Haunt requires a tithe of glamour, favors, and/or kindness to remain friendly towards the occupants, or else they become neutral, and at worst, hostile.<br /> <br /> <b>Consumed By Thorns (\u2022): </b>The last resort, the curtain call, the venus fly trap snapping shut. In a conscious decision made on part of all members of the motley who have contributed Merit dots to the Hollow, the Hollow begins to self-destruct. Everyone inside has one turn to escape, two turns with one dot of Size Matters, or five turns with two dots of Size Matters. When the countdown ends, all people still inside the Hollow take aggravated damage equal to the Hollow\u2019s rating and the Hollow is destroyed, downgrading the area to Thorns. The Hollow owners do not have to be within the Hollow to activate this effect. They may reallocate any dots assigned to the destroyed Hollow (see Sanctity of Merits).<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> <b>Exotic Goods (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022, Motley)</b><br /> Prerequisite: Hollow, Luxury Goods Enhancement<br /> When rolling her Hollow rating as a dice pool for Luxury Goods, the player gains one automatic success per dot of Exotic Goods. The successes rolled may now be split up amongst multiple items with a total Availability or dot rating equal to the rolled successes. These items now last until the sun next crosses the horizon, instead of a scene.<br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Proud creator of <b><a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/420206/Curiouser-and-Curiouser-Bargains\" target=\"_blank\">Curiouser and Curiouser Bargains</a></b>, a collection of 30+ Homebrew Contracts and 10+ Entitlements on the STV!<br /> My <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GFE19F9st7dhGh9zv_hEQyOSm80Xp7dQwmvFg2SAXJY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules</a></b> for Changeling!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17SsOsKpfdANVZscFHSO_afTx-gD3h0iX3p5q07V4u50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Vampire!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kR6ASTLjaEDwl3zgANnkRrbk0-s2bvw40uXwS-q15O0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Geist!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27667-super-vlad","name":"Super Vlad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27667_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}